    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e597523466721596f35292",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革也加入荒漠英雄跟谷野美酒的话题，\n三人聊得越来越热烈。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ecde1ca48775715cbe68622095d6481e9108c5e8d5871804ac7b6512dce757",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
