      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而站在我身旁的吉兆\n也用沈稳表情默默守护着那三人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39d5a0eadef076dbac5125db62e2966111120e472070edf56d9010562d3d0f83",
